<!-- ★ FIX141-CARDSTYLE: karta guruhining "bottom" qismi.

     ═══ NEGA CHEGARA (stroke) YO'Q ═══

     Har bir item alohida View bo'lgani uchun chegara qo'yilsa,
     qo'shni itemlar orasida IKKI QAVAT chiziq ko'rinadi:

         ┌───────────┐  ← top (pastki chegara)
         ├───────────┤  ← 2dp! (top past + mid yuqori)
         │   qator   │  ← mid (yuqori chegara)
         ├───────────┤  ← yana 2dp
         └───────────┘  ← bottom

     Shuning uchun chegara OLIB TASHLANDI — karta faqat FON RANGI
     bilan ajralib turadi (@color/card_bg), bu yetarli.

     Burchaklar esa qismga qarab beriladi — natijada BITTA karta
     ko'rinadi.
-->
<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shape="rectangle">
    <solid android:color="@color/card_bg"/>
    <corners android:topLeftRadius="0dp" android:topRightRadius="0dp" android:bottomLeftRadius="16dp" android:bottomRightRadius="16dp"/>
</shape>
